stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Waiting
  Waiting --> Active : verified owner and supported session
  Waiting --> Unsupported : unsupported game mode
  Unsupported --> Waiting : mode or session changes
  Active --> Ended : source-supported end
  Active --> Waiting : confirmed owner or actual session change
  Ended --> Waiting : next session

  note right of Active
    Source invalidity, age or a capture gap
    withdraws only affected live assertions.
    Preserve verified identity and watermark.
    A regressed clock alone is not a new match.
    CV geometry cannot invalidate valid GSI.
  end note
  note right of Waiting
    Confirmed new owner or session increments epoch.
    Fence old work; reset relevant baselines and selection.
    Source-health transitions are tracked separately.
  end note
  note right of Ended
    Completion needs explicit source evidence.
    Crash or disconnect leaves partial or unknown outcome.
  end note

